# Guard for build-tarball's conditional patch application.
# Format: [!]<relpath-in-tarball>:<grep -E regex>   (ALL lines must hold)
# A leading '!' negates (the pattern must NOT be present).
#
# 0011 gates the meshstor stage-1 fail-the-write COMPLETION arms (R1BIO_P2PError
# / R10BIO_P2PError), which exist only in the full stage-1 tree. Guard on
# R10BIO_P2PError so this patch self-excludes from an advertise-only variant
# (e.g. a pin that advertises P2PDMA but has fail-the-write ABSENT), where these
# hunks would reject against code that does not exist. 0008's advertise gating
# applies to both variants; only these arm hunks are stage-1-only.
raid10.c:R10BIO_P2PError
